# CUI // SP-CTI
# IQE Query: FRH-001
# Title: FedRAMP High — All Unsatisfied Controls
# Framework: FedRAMP High
# Category: gap-analysis
# Severity: critical
# Description: FedRAMP High represents the baseline for systems processing
#   highly sensitive government data. Any unsatisfied control is a critical
#   risk to the authorisation boundary and must appear in the POA&M immediately.

# Written in the retired cATO regex engine's dialect (framework('X').controls,
# starts_with, is null); bdt-iqe-1 moved that surface to compliance.twin_snapshots,
# startswith and == null (tools/genesis/reflexes/cato_twin.py), so this is the same query.
foreach ctrl in compliance.twin_snapshots('FedRAMP High')
where ctrl.status != 'satisfied'
select ctrl.control_id, ctrl.implementation_status, ctrl.project_id, ctrl.score
